  astInterface_rex_test2026_stl_regex

  # These integration tests remain in regular and sanitizer CTest.  Under
  # Memcheck, interfaceFunctionCoverage spends more than four hours translating
  # standard-library headers before its SageInterface traversal, while each
  # anonymous-tag contract pulls a roughly 12,000-line preprocessed specimen
  # through three serialized move-declaration modes.  The bounded interface
  # specimen runs the same coverage executable over the relevant AST shapes.
  # The bounded move-declaration contract runs the same three tool modes and
  # hard-checks anonymous-tag identity without unrelated library declarations.
  astInterface_interfaceFunctionCoverage
  moveDecl_rex_anonymous_tag_identity_inputmoveDeclarationToInnermostScope_test2014_18_C
  moveDecl_rex_anonymous_tag_identity_inputmoveDeclarationToInnermostScope_test2014_22_C

